{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"ResilientPaywallService","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPaywall"}],"externalID":"s:13SwiduxPaywall09ResilientB7ServiceV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Wraps a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ResilientPaywallService"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" populates ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — and therefore the feature gate,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account display, and whether the paywall sheet is shown — entirely from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"snapshots its wrapped service emits. A slow, silent, or throwing entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read at cold launch leaves that state at its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"free"},{"type":"text","text":" default. This decorator"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps a persisted last-known-good so the gate never collapses to free on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transient failure, while the server remains the authoritative gate: a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live snapshot always overwrites the cache, so a genuine lapse is honoured."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The cache is bounded by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxCacheAge"},{"text":" (72 hours by default): a stale cache","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stops vouching for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"text":" — subscriptions lapse, and an install that stays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"offline past the bound must not keep pro forever — but keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", because lifetime purchases don’t expire."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic by construction — it speaks only "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", so it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"wraps any base (simulated, RevenueCat, StoreKit, …). Feed the wrapped instance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"both"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and any app-side reader that builds a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monetization\/context payload from entitlements."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Back the cache with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"text":": the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cache vouches for a paid entitlement offline, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UserDefaults"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a user can edit or restore from a doctored backup, whereas the Keychain is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not plist-editable. (On unsigned macOS dev builds the Keychain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"errSecMissingEntitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ −34018 — see "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sandboxing &","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entitlements (macOS)","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":".)"}]},{"code":["let resilient = ResilientPaywallService(","    base: paywallService,","    store: KeychainKeyValueStore(service: \"com.example.myapp\")",")","\/\/ PaywallPlugin(..., service: resilient)   \/\/ gate + account display","\/\/ await resilient.currentSnapshot()        \/\/ server payload, off-main"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Threat model","type":"heading","anchor":"Threat-model","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Backed by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyValueStore"},{"type":"text","text":", the cache defends against casual plist"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"editing and a doctored-backup restore: the persisted last-known-good is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encrypted and not a user-editable file. It does "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" defend against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"jailbroken device — nothing client-side does; entitlements can always be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forged on a device the attacker fully controls. The live provider stays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authoritative whenever the app is online: any live snapshot overwrites the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cache, so a genuine lapse or downgrade is honoured on the next successful","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":" deliberately never expires — a lifetime purchase","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"must keep working offline indefinitely.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice"]}],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/restorePurchases()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Restores previously completed purchases, forwarding to the base service.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Persists on success; rethrows on failure (a restore is an explicit user","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action, so the plugin keeps the prior state).","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/restorePurchases()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"restorePurchases()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"restorePurchases"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/restorepurchases()"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/init(base:store:maxattempts:seedsfromcache:maxcacheage:retrybasedelay:now:)","title":"init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/init(base:store:maxAttempts:seedsFromCache:maxCacheAge:retryBaseDelay:now:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PaywallService","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B7ServiceP"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyValueStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux13KeyValueStoreP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"maxAttempts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"seedsFromCache"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxCacheAge"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"retryBaseDelay"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a resilient decorator around ","type":"text"},{"code":"base","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", persisting last-known-good"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"through ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallService":{"type":"topic","title":"PaywallService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallservice","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider-agnostic paywall service protocol."}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallState":{"type":"topic","title":"PaywallState","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallstate","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallState","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PaywallState"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Current paywall state — entitlement status, sheet presentation, and async progress."}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/PaywallPlugin":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/paywallplugin","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Swidux plugin that manages paywall state and entitlement checking."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallPlugin","title":"PaywallPlugin","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PaywallPlugin","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Wraps a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" so a transient failure to read entitlements never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents a previously-seen paid user as free."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService","title":"ResilientPaywallService","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ResilientPaywallService","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfo()":{"kind":"symbol","title":"customerInfo()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfo()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfo()","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerInfo","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the current entitlement status, retrying up to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxAttempts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with exponential backoff. On success persists and returns; if every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"attempt fails, returns the cached last-known-good when present and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usable, otherwise rethrows (so the plugin’s honest "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".refreshFailed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path is preserved for a genuinely-unknown user). Cancellation stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrying immediately and falls through to the cache."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/customerInfoStream()":{"type":"topic","title":"customerInfoStream()","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/customerinfostream()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/customerInfoStream()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customerInfoStream","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV","text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Long-lived stream of entitlement updates. Yields the persisted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"last-known-good first (when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seedsFromCache"},{"type":"text","text":" is on and the cache is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still usable), then forwards and persists every snapshot the base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream emits. The seed has source "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cacheSeed"},{"type":"text","text":", so it can bootstrap the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plugin’s gate without superseding a pending or completed live read."}]},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall","title":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPaywall/documentation/SwiduxPaywall/ResilientPaywallService/currentSnapshot()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"currentSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitlementSnapshot","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall19EntitlementSnapshotV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpaywall\/resilientpaywallservice\/currentsnapshot()","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxPaywall\/ResilientPaywallService\/currentSnapshot()","type":"topic","title":"currentSnapshot()","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Non-throwing read for callers that always want a snapshot, degrading to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"free only for a genuinely-unknown user. Convenient for building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-request monetization context off the main actor.","type":"text"}]}}}